"""Solve and display the field on a completed SCS Mesh Generator mesh.

Mesh settings come from the open mesh dock, or its last generated settings.
The visualizer requires a verified mesh for the live lead. It solves per-contact
basis fields once per model/background configuration; montage changes only
combine those fields. A cluster solve keeps its solution there and plots from
each contact's potential at the drawn surfaces (surface_basis.py). It does not
generate meshes or save the CAD document.
"""
import json
import os
import sys

import FreeCAD
import FreeCADGui

